{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c2e3fe0ce730bd9f3cecd9c147e5be956a6acdad33d2bc6c1ac5ce722f233473","ja":"夢を叶えるために","zh":"为了实现梦想","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"378a0536ecc676837785456628d64aaaa85933387b657d60f18366d479420518","ja":"「さぁ、運命の最終問題！\n正解なら賞金1000万円！　不正解ならすべて没収！」","zh":"“那么，来到命运的最后一题！\n回答正确即可获得奖金1000万日元！答错则全部没收！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7d8a87d942a9b8acd4d60441245cf22569aadfdf89544ef8fd489d0836c63395","ja":"「アイドルチームが選択したのはAですが、\n果たして正解は…………」","zh":"「偶像队选择的是A，\n那么正确答案究竟是…………」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d3dbd3cf80cd377d78379db70b851e5e48bbc18d0b58083a05b81df9f255ece8","ja":"ロコちゃん、あゆあゆ、ごめんね。\n最後の問題で間違えちゃって……。","zh":"ROCO、步步，对不起。\n我在最后一题搞错了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d4ef5b161aca3c411ded12f8187dd3a3c1719cff0363b179107ec741159f4e5b","ja":"気にしないでください！\nロコも正解はAだって思ってましたから！","zh":"请不要介意！\n因为ROCO也以为正确答案是A呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"dec995802a40826f2a4d2ec5f0487a46f5176650ff70b28e4bcda24880ec3bb1","ja":"そうそう、気にすることないって！","zh":"就是说嘛，不用放在心上啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9a321f540d3a54b2e122b2e43d2c1ee353bd9a4f40bfdfb42489805512831e5f","ja":"麗花がいなかったら、\n序盤で不正解になって退場になってたんだしさ。","zh":"要是丽花不在的话，\n一开始答错就得出局了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7ab67290f2db325b79eddda240b2ee85bae3a9050e09fb82f84782f87bc7c66d","ja":"それに、3人でスリルを味わえましたし、\n大きな夢も見れて、とっても楽しかったです！","zh":"而且不仅3个人体会到了刺激感，\n还见到了远大的梦想，真的非常开心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8f510d1751dfefe882a9ab24b7c0b0859000e094c8997cec3d05aabc1496e188","ja":"えへへっ♪　私もすっごく楽しかったな♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪　我也觉得超级开心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"96dcd2b2b966e6778f2febeb2e88053dee5515cc690894b7e41226aeabd2d1d7","ja":"賞金がなくなったのは残念ですけど……\n夢はロコたちで叶えればいいんですよね！","zh":"虽然奖金没了很可惜……\n但梦想只要靠ROCO她们自己去实现就好了对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d89687f214e09852d8dab9746e96f7b913b5e15080c921b9e2669d6596c35944","ja":"そうだよな！　アイドルで大成功したら、\nダンス大会の夢だって叶えられるし♪","zh":"就是说啊！要是作为偶像大获成功，\n舞蹈大赛的梦想也能实现嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c066c3bd8b776b7de20c17ad135202ae9ecebd2e2cfbaf21986446ab81a967ea","ja":"ロコは、いつか自分の力でロコアートの個展を\n大々的に開催してみせますよ！","zh":"ROCO总有一天要靠自己的力量，\n大张旗鼓地举办ROCO艺术个展给您看哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"d722b618178452b1a7e345ae7286675d24a0bd4cf46ad454868cf90d06a7681b","ja":"それじゃあ私は、劇場のエントランスに\nお～っきな山のオブジェを作っちゃおうかな～♪","zh":"那我干脆在剧场的入口大堂，\n做一个大大大大山峰艺术装置吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"1c76c9eec1d029fbb896ad86c7b5d4bbd39166d6c25f569b71173debb224045f","ja":"いや、それはさすがに邪魔になるから！","zh":"不，那个不管怎么说都很碍事啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"5088f35c72b6616774265b008d50b907be5d2ec2f9827cfb40ec8e6cf316804e","ja":"ふふっ♪　レイカ、アユム、夢を叶えるためにも、\nこれからも一緒に頑張りましょう！","zh":"呵呵♪　丽花、步，为了实现梦想，\n今后也一起努力吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1322.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"92613d18dae083e729fa1664f7664d3c732a888258a41eed9849736979365387","ja":"うん。そのためにも、また一緒に、\nハラハラドキドキしちゃうようなことしようね♪","zh":"嗯。为了达到这个目的，我们之后也\n一起做些让人心跳加速的事情吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
